0.055 0.09 0.16 rg 0 737 612 55 re f
0.76 0.08 0.19 rg 0 734 612 3 re f
1 1 1 rg BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 767 Tm (SAHAYAK | CBSE SCIENCE EXHIBITION STUDY GUIDE) Tj ET
0.055 0.09 0.16 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 701 Tm (Judge Q&A bank \(1/3\)) Tj ET
0.94 0.96 0.98 RG 1 w 44 693 m 568 693 l S
0.5 0.54 0.6 rg BT /F1 6.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 18.2 Tm (Based on SAHAYAK-ISL code/deployment notes | October 2026) Tj ET
0.5 0.54 0.6 rg BT /F2 6.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 544 18.2 Tm (21) Tj ET
0.37 0.41 0.47 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 670.3 Tm (Purpose/features/maths.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 654.1 Tm (Q1. What is SAHAYAK?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 640.1 Tm (A prototype recognizing a limited trained set of hand signs from camera landmarks; it can show and speak output.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 625.8 Tm (Q2. What problem does it address?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 611.8 Tm (It demonstrates a low-friction technical aid for interactions where sign-based and spoken/written communication need support.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 597.5 Tm (Q3. Is it a complete ISL translator?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 583.5 Tm (No. It classifies known labels and does not fully interpret grammar, facial expression, spatial information or spontaneous) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 573.2 Tm (conversation.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 558.9 Tm (Q4. What does real time mean?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 544.9 Tm (The browser processes frames continually and requests predictions; total speed depends on device, network and server.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 530.6 Tm (Q5. What is a landmark?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 516.6 Tm (A tracked key point represented by numeric coordinates.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 502.3 Tm (Q6. How many hand landmarks?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 488.3 Tm (21 per hand in the MediaPipe Hands representation.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 474 Tm (Q7. Why normalize coordinates?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 460 Tm (To reduce sensitivity to translation and scale, not eliminate all viewpoint/occlusion issues.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 445.7 Tm (Q8. Why 126 static features?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 431.7 Tm (2 hand slots x 21 landmarks x 3 coordinates = 126.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 417.4 Tm (Q9. Why 132 sequence values per frame?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 403.4 Tm (126 pose values plus 6 wrist-position values.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 389.1 Tm (Q10. Why 1,320 sequence features?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 375.1 Tm (Ten resampled time bins x 132 = 1,320.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
