0.94 0.96 0.98 RG 1 w 44 693 m 568 693 l S
0.5 0.54 0.6 rg BT /F1 6.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 18.2 Tm (Based on SAHAYAK-ISL code/deployment notes | October 2026) Tj ET
0.5 0.54 0.6 rg BT /F2 6.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 544 18.2 Tm (22) Tj ET
0.37 0.41 0.47 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 670.3 Tm (Model, data collection and evaluation.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 654.1 Tm (Q11. Which algorithm is used?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 640.1 Tm (The backend loads scikit-learn-compatible classifiers with Joblib; inspect artifact to confirm exact estimator because trainer) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 629.8 Tm (scripts are missing.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 615.5 Tm (Q12. Does adding a label train the model?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 601.5 Tm (No. Train a model on labelled examples and save a new artifact.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 587.2 Tm (Q13. How add a static sign?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 573.2 Tm (Collect 126-feature rows, train, test on held-out sessions/signers, regression-test old labels, then promote.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 558.9 Tm (Q14. How add a moving sign?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 544.9 Tm (Collect 132-value frames in order, resample to 1,320, train/evaluate a separate classifier, then promote.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 530.6 Tm (Q15. How many samples are enough?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 516.6 Tm (No universal number. Use a balanced varied collection and report actual counts and held-out results.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 502.3 Tm (Q16. What is confidence?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 488.3 Tm (Top-class probability if supported, not a guarantee.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 474 Tm (Q17. What is the 60% threshold?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 460 Tm (Current code accepts static predictions at >=0.60 and sequence when probabilities exist; it is not accuracy.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 445.7 Tm (Q18. How measure accuracy?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 431.7 Tm (Use unseen labelled examples, confusion matrix, accuracy and per-class precision/recall/F1.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 417.4 Tm (Q19. How avoid overfitting?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 403.4 Tm (Split by signer/session, vary conditions, balance labels, test new examples.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 389.1 Tm (Q20. Can GitHub train it?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 375.1 Tm (Yes through configured Codespaces/Actions after scripts and data inputs exist; normal editor cannot record webcam by itself.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
