0.5 0.54 0.6 rg BT /F1 6.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 18.2 Tm (Based on SAHAYAK-ISL code/deployment notes | October 2026) Tj ET
0.5 0.54 0.6 rg BT /F2 6.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 544 18.2 Tm (23) Tj ET
0.37 0.41 0.47 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 670.3 Tm (Architecture, privacy, deployment and future improvements.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 654.1 Tm (Q21. Where does camera run?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 640.1 Tm (MediaPipe Hands runs in browser; numeric features go to Render classifier.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 625.8 Tm (Q22. Fully offline?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 611.8 Tm (No. CDN tracker, remote classifier, translation and gTTS require internet; some fixed translations may work offline.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 597.5 Tm (Q23. Important routes?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 583.5 Tm (/api/health, /api/status, /api/predict-features, /api/sequence/predict, /api/sequence/samples, /api/sequence/export, /api/translate,) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 573.2 Tm (/api/speech.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 558.9 Tm (Q24. What does Vercel do?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 544.9 Tm (Hosts the static frontend and deploys GitHub-connected UI changes.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 530.6 Tm (Q25. What does Render do?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 516.6 Tm (Hosts Flask backend and model files.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 502.3 Tm (Q26. Where are sequences stored?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 488.3 Tm (continuous_gesture_db.db via sequence_db.py; ephemeral storage isn't guaranteed durable.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 474 Tm (Q27. Where is history?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 460 Tm (Browser localStorage.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 445.7 Tm (Q28. Is raw video always sent?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 431.7 Tm (Primary Studio path sends features; legacy /api/predict can accept images.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 417.4 Tm (Q29. Main limitations?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 403.4 Tm (Small label set, no held-out accuracy report, online dependencies, camera sensitivity and missing reusable trainer scripts.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 389.1 Tm (Q30. Next milestone?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 375.1 Tm (Private Dataset Lab, trainers, held-out evaluation, persistent storage and guarded model promotion.) Tj ET
endstream
