0.5 0.54 0.6 rg BT /F2 6.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 544 18.2 Tm (24) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 668 Tm (Can you prove 98% accuracy?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 653.3 Tm (No held-out report is stored, so do not claim it. Use unseen labelled data and per-class results.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 635.1 Tm (Why sometimes wrong?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 620.4 Tm (Similar poses, limited/imbalanced samples, occlusion, lighting, camera angle, segmentation and training coverage can cause) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 608.5 Tm (errors.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 590.3 Tm (Does 60% confidence mean 60% accuracy?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 575.6 Tm (No. It is a decision threshold on class probability, not test-set accuracy.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 557.4 Tm (What if internet fails?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 542.7 Tm (Remote classification, CDN tracking, general translation and server speech may fail. Some fixed bundled phrases may still) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 530.8 Tm (work.) Tj ET
0.12 0.4 0.7 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 512.6 Tm (How protect training contributors?) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 497.9 Tm (Obtain consent, restrict capture/export, avoid public identifiable data, limit retention, secure APIs and use durable) Tj ET
0.11 0.14 0.19 rg BT /F1 8.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 486 Tm (storage.) Tj ET
